Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part A}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.83,0:00:23.96,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,We’re heading off!{Dokimeki}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.09,0:00:30.64,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,The kids{Liko-tachi} went to go shopping in town?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.64,0:00:33.93,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Yeah, said there was \N a bunch of stuff they wanted to buy.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.39,0:00:39.10,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,And the rain’s finally let up, \N so it should make for a nice change of pace.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.56,0:00:44.11,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.48,0:00:47.69,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Those kids sure have grown \N more dependable, haven’t they?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.69,0:00:49.11,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Where’d that come from?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.11,0:00:53.87,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Back when they originally joined the ship, \N we had to go shopping along with them.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.58,0:00:58.75,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Dot, Liko, and Roy... \N At first, we couldn’t take our eyes off them.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.83,0:01:02.29,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Same for Ult.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.79,0:01:05.21,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,{\t(1566,2317,\3c&HFFFFFF&)}He’s grown up quite a bit.{pronoun-less so could be Ult or all the kids, but went with He for the scene}{I think that makes sense. -ed}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.21,0:01:09.72,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,They’ve all been on lots of adventures, \N and experienced so much! {19:20}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.43,0:01:15.85,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Looking at them, sometimes it makes you \N wonder if {\i1}you’re{\i0} growing at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.60,0:01:22.15,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Hey, hold it in...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:23.06,0:01:27.82,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,{Sniff... }It’s just... I’ve known Dot \N since she was a baby, y’know...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:31.53,0:01:34.78,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Just how it goes. \N Kids grow up fast.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:39.87,0:01:41.54,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.54,0:01:44.75,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Weakened Pokémon \N were spotted nearby.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.75,0:01:46.17,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,I’ll go check it out.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.17,0:01:46.92,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.92,0:01:48.42,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.42,0:01:51.01,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Let’s go, Lucky and Ikkanezumi.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.93,0:01:58.60,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Well then, suppose I’ll do some \N maintenance in the engine room!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.60,0:02:01.85,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,And I should think on \N tonight’s dinner menu...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.52,0:02:07.40,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Am I going to have to \N bring back the diet menu?
Comment: 0,0:02:21.87,0:02:21.87,Main,,0,0,0,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:51.96,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part B}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.35,0:04:05.35,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.11,0:04:13.69,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Magmag?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.11,0:04:15.69,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Toroggon?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.21,0:04:29.46,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Nope, haven’t seen ‘em.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.92,0:04:32.96,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,It’s so strange. \N They’re nowhere to be found.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.96,0:04:36.01,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Don’t suppose \N they went out for a walk?{Won't they be strolling around the neighbourhood?}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.01,0:04:40.55,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Magmag and Toroggon aren’t generally \N big on leaving the engine room...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.55,0:04:42.60,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Hey, what should I put on today’s menu?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.60,0:04:45.18,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,I just can’t think of anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.35,0:04:47.77,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,They didn’t run away, did they?! {They couldn't have run away?!}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.77,0:04:51.73,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Run away... Run away, huh...? {katakana, taking iede as some thing for the menu}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.48,0:04:58.28,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.28,0:05:00.74,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,I’ll go with this one.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.74,0:05:02.95,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,That just leaves...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.20,0:05:08.83,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I think she said she liked these, \N didn’t she?{non-gendered in JP, but at a bread shop, I guess this is leading in to the hamburger line}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.92,0:05:22.01,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Those look tasty!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.59,0:05:24.43,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I want a crêpe!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.18,0:05:27.06,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Should we have a little break?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.06,0:05:28.31,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.31,0:05:32.81,Main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,Welcome! As a special treat{service} for today, \N I’ll give you extra whipped cream!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.81,0:05:33.98,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.98,0:05:38.23,Main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,Yep! That rainy spell finally let up, \N so I’m in a good mood!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.99,0:05:40.99,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Awright!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.99,0:05:40.99,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yay!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.99,0:05:42.70,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Thanks so much!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.58,0:05:51.79,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.12,0:05:54.33,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,That’s a big mountain...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.33,0:05:56.75,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,The coloring’s pretty unusual. {TL: Those are unusual colors.}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.42,0:06:02.05,Main,Man,0,0,0,,That rocky mountain, y’see... \N It used to be a coal mine.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.05,0:06:04.18,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Huh, you don’t say...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.18,0:06:06.18,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What’s a “colmine”?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.18,0:06:08.56,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,It’s a place where you dig up coal.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.56,0:06:12.73,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Even the Brave Asagi \N uses energy from burnin’ coal to fly!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.73,0:06:15.56,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Oh, I know that! \N It’s so powerful!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.56,0:06:19.15,Main,Man,0,0,0,,But that coal mine \N isn’t in use anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.15,0:06:21.03,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Why’s that?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.44,0:06:26.95,Main,Man,0,0,0,,They say a tough rock wall \N blocked them from digging any farther.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.95,0:06:28.41,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,That so...?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.41,0:06:35.04,Main,Man,0,0,0,,The young folk decided it was hopeless, \N gave up, and found other jobs.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.75,0:06:39.96,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,They gave up, huh...?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.18,0:06:49.93,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Donmel!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.93,0:06:52.14,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,You guys okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.19,0:06:57.52,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Low body temp!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.52,0:06:59.07,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,We’ve gotta warm them up.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.21,0:07:17.83,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Thanks, Lucky!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.13,0:07:24.09,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Ikkanezumi, fan it with your leaves!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.40,0:07:38.65,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,They’re wet.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.06,0:07:42.94,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,That explains why \N they didn’t want to catch fire.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.11,0:07:48.20,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Maybe they cooled down severely \N due to the constant rain...{weird line. possibly referring to the index entries mentioning Donmel's weakness to rain, as she's looking at her ~~index~~ MOBILE TELEPHONE as she says it. -ed}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.95,0:07:51.33,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Though I doubt that could \N {\i1}fully{\i0} explain it...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.95,0:07:57.71,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Guess I really am \N going to need a bigger flame...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.51,0:08:08.59,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,You guys?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.02,0:08:18.64,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.64,0:08:20.23,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,But why are you here?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.23,0:08:21.69,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.61,0:08:31.57,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Oh, so you were following them.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.16,0:08:35.08,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Toroggon’s footsteps \N stand out, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.08,0:08:39.83,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,I was worried about \N where they could’ve gone.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.83,0:08:45.50,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,But as fellow Fire types, they must’ve realized \N there were Pokémon in trouble.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.50,0:08:47.84,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Whatever the case, it’s {\i1}freezing{\i0} here!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.84,0:08:50.76,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Too cold for Donmel to be living here...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.76,0:08:53.10,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,There’s most likely {\i1}some{\i0} explanation...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.68,0:08:57.73,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,“I want to learn why it’s so cold!” \N is what Liko’d say if she was here!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.73,0:09:02.35,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,And Roy would leap into action, \N going “Let’s check the area, stat!”
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.87,0:09:26.88,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Maybe, because of the constant rain, \N the face of the mountain over there collapsed.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.88,0:09:30.76,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,And that changed the wind currents...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.55,0:09:35.39,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Leading to a rapid drop \N in temperature around here.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.14,0:09:39.39,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,That could be hard on \N Fire Pokémon like Donmel.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.14,0:09:42.98,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Nature reshapes itself as it wishes.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.98,0:09:45.82,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,We can’t do anything about that, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.82,0:09:49.65,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Let’s find these guys \N a better place to live!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.95,0:09:55.32,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Why not try going \N closer to that mountain?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.32,0:09:57.79,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,We might find somewhere warmer!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.47,0:10:23.14,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,That reminds me, why did Magmag \N and Toroggon come aboard the ship?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.14,0:10:23.98,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.98,0:10:27.73,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,I mean, they were already \N living with you when I joined.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.48,0:10:30.48,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Those guys...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.61,0:10:40.04,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,When I was building \N the Brave Asagi on Friede’s request...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.63,0:10:49.63,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Hmm... That’s not enough heat.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.38,0:10:54.38,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Gonna need a bigger flame \N if we want to make a ship fly...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.14,0:10:57.80,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.60,0:11:00.14,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.64,0:11:06.60,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,A wild Magmag... \N When’d that get in there?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.44,0:11:13.82,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,And a Toroggon!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.41,0:11:24.21,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,You like it here?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.71,0:11:29.96,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,We’re gonna go flying through the skies!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.96,0:11:32.09,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,If you want, you can come with us!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.07,0:12:00.20,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,I {\i1}thought{\i0} they’d taken a liking \N to the engine room I built,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.20,0:12:02.45,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,but maybe they’d realized...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.41,0:12:09.71,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,If they came aboard the Brave Asagi, \N their own power could take them anywhere!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.38,0:12:12.71,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Same as us, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.46,0:12:14.92,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Yup!
Comment: 0,0:12:30.48,0:12:30.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part C}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.49,0:12:40.66,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Doubt there’s any other path.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.78,0:12:43.03,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Metagross!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.04,0:12:47.37,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Okay, climb on.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.09,0:12:56.13,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.63,0:13:00.30,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Metagross, \N take them to the other side!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.48,0:13:09.89,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,See, it’s okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.85,0:13:12.98,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,The only scary part is the first step.{003}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.90,0:13:16.28,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. \N We’re all here with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.90,0:14:01.95,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Hey! Why’d ya kick me out?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.95,0:14:06.08,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Sorry, Murdock! \N Let us use the kitchen, just for today!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.66,0:14:08.70,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,If you’re making something, \N I can help!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.70,0:14:11.75,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,I was just trying to think \N what I should put on the menu!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.75,0:14:15.54,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Don’t worry! \N You just relax, Murdock!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.80,0:14:25.05,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Phew... Looks like \N we’re in the clear for now.{Looks like we're not exposed for now, huh? - secret being kept term, rather than baseball safety term}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.43,0:14:28.76,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Everybody ready, then? \N Let’s get going!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.76,0:14:29.31,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.28,0:14:47.49,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,It’s a bit warmer over here...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.49,0:14:51.66,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,But if the wind changes again, \N this area would cool down too.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.58,0:14:58.42,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Is there some other option...?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.42,0:15:03.55,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,{\q2}Rather than trying to get them somewhere warm, \N we’d be better off warming them up from the inside.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.55,0:15:07.59,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,If we could melt down the magma \N that cooled and hardened inside their bodies,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.59,0:15:09.81,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,they could live here fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.18,0:15:13.81,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,That’s {\i1}if{\i0} we can produce \N enough heat to do that...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.66,0:15:28.95,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Rails?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.95,0:15:31.12,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Probably for a minecart... {トロッコ}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.71,0:15:38.29,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Oh, I knew it! \N There was a coal mine here!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.29,0:15:40.71,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,If there’s coal in there...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.71,0:15:42.25,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Let’s check it out!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.68,0:15:52.39,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.77,0:15:59.44,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,A dead end, huh...?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.44,0:16:07.15,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,This is coal!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.74,0:16:10.03,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Meaning this really is a coal mine...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.03,0:16:12.70,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,But everything’s \N already been dug out?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.70,0:16:15.79,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Hmm, isn’t there \N {\i1}any{\i0} left somewhere...?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.33,0:16:21.79,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,This is pretty tough. \N I bet they couldn’t dig any further.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.79,0:16:24.76,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,And after we’ve come so far...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.11,0:16:43.90,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,You guys...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.90,0:16:46.86,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,They believe that \N there’s more beyond the wall!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.28,0:16:55.08,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Then let’s join them! Metagross!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.41,0:16:59.79,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Yeah, we’re not giving up! Lucky!{"Yeah" to represent that this follows Orio's atashi-tachi mo}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.93,0:17:18.14,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Magmag...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.69,0:17:21.77,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Toroggon...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.53,0:17:28.53,Main,Orio Molly,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.13,0:17:46.17,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Magcargot!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.38,0:17:49.46,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Sekitanzan!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.22,0:17:57.43,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Looks like...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.43,0:17:58.31,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,...this could work!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.88,0:18:26.54,Main,Orio Molly,0,0,0,,Coal!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.10,0:18:49.36,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Looks like the magma \N in their bodies has warmed up.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.36,0:18:51.82,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,That’s a relief! \N Now they’ll be fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.49,0:18:54.57,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Thanks, you guys.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.57,0:18:57.07,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,And congrats on evolving!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.64,0:19:21.35,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,You {\i1}have{\i0} been on \N lots of adventures, after all.{1:05}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.40,0:19:33.49,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,You’ve got that right— \N Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.11,0:19:37.45,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Uhh...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.45,0:19:38.87,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,What’s the celebration?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.87,0:19:41.54,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,It’s a “Thanks for all you do!” party!{itsumo arigatou}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.54,0:19:44.20,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,We want to show how much \N we appreciate you always taking care of us!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.20,0:19:45.58,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Surprise!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.25,0:19:47.50,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,...‘s the gist of it!{Ult closing out with a sentence ender despite doing none of the explaining}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.50,0:19:50.00,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,So that’s why you went shopping!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.00,0:19:53.05,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Ooh, hamburgers! I love those!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.05,0:19:54.84,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,What a pretty chopped salad!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.84,0:19:56.88,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Hehe, whatcha think?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.88,0:20:00.47,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,And they made this cake without \N any help from me, isn’t that amazing?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.47,0:20:02.64,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi baked cookies!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.31,0:20:06.64,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Never thought {\i1}you’d{\i0} be \N making {\i1}me{\i0} sweets!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.39,0:20:11.65,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Orio, Molly, Murdock, sincerely... \N Thanks for all you do!{itsumo arigatou}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.65,0:20:13.57,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,I’m touched. But...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.78,0:20:16.95,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,...we should be the ones \N thanking {\i1}you!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.95,0:20:20.91,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,We’re always learning \N so much from you{Liko-tachi}. Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.41,0:20:23.66,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Yet again...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.12,0:20:28.79,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I don’t care what, \N let’s just get eatin’!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.79,0:20:31.04,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi’s starving!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.25,0:20:34.55,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Then let’s have a toast!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.26,0:20:44.93,Main,Them,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cheers!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.86,0:20:57.53,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.91,0:21:03.20,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Magmag became Magcargot!{Magmag, into Magcargot...}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.03,0:21:06.33,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Toroggon became Sekitanzan!{Toroggon, into Sekitanzan...}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.08,0:21:09.16,Main,Orio Molly,0,0,0,,They evolved!{...has evolved!}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.16,0:21:10.37,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.37,0:21:13.21,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,They’re both mega-cool, \N ain’t they?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.30,0:21:20.88,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Now that’s a surprise... \N When did that happen?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.88,0:21:23.54,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Being around you kids{anta-tachi} all the time...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.54,0:21:26.85,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,It tends to make you grow \N without even realizing it!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:34.73,0:21:36.07,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Don’t worry!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.07,0:21:38.86,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,I’ll be sure to remodel it \N nice and big for ya!
Comment: 0,0:21:45.49,0:21:45.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie A}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.79,0:21:48.37,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Friede here!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.37,0:21:51.96,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It’s time to Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.00,0:21:55.21,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Today’s topic is Magcargot!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.21,0:21:58.84,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,{\q2}Its body constantly undulates, and is as hot as lava.{ENgame: Y: Its body is as hot as lava and is always billowing.}{No linebreak to not cover up the second ability}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:58.84,0:22:02.68,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,But do you know how hot \N Magcargot’s body temperature is?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.26,0:22:06.47,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,See the answer after the commercials!
Comment: 0,0:22:06.47,0:22:06.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{Ending}
Comment: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:36.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie B}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.32,0:23:42.11,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Time to announce \N the correct answer!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.11,0:23:43.86,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,The answer is...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:43.86,0:23:45.86,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,C: 10,000 degrees!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.86,0:23:48.66,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Intense flames flow \N throughout its body,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:48.66,0:23:51.37,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,and can even gush \N out of the shell on its back!{ENgame: X: Its shell occasionally spouts intense flames that circulate throughout its body.}
Comment: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:00.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:01.96,0:24:05.34,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ooh! Yamirami! \N That’s one sweet rock ya found!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:05.34,0:24:07.09,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I’m adding it straight to my collection!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:07.09,0:24:09.39,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You really like rocks, don’t you, Ult?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:09.39,0:24:11.14,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,He’s got piles of them in his room.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:12.01,0:24:14.56,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yeah! Wanna see my great collection?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:14.56,0:24:17.23,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,This rock I picked up \N on the streets of Miare.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:17.23,0:24:19.15,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,This rock’s from Blueberry Academy!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:19.15,0:24:21.65,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,And this rock I found in \N the Kitakami hamlet!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:21.65,0:24:22.94,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,That’s some passion...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:22.94,0:24:26.44,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And so, to be continued \N next time on Pocket Monsters!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:26.44,0:24:29.70,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Ult and Yamirami! A Bond Harder Than Rock!!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,
